  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4l2xQ83.png\" alt=\"applecrates\" width=\"1127\" height=\"164\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>Apple Crates</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>交易與裝飾</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Apple Crates 添加了基於原版木材類型的新方塊，你可以在其中儲存和交易物品！&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些方塊允許你儲存物品。它們擁有 29 個槽位，比箱子多兩個，</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">並且還具備簡單商店的額外功能！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">製作需要使用 3 個木板和 2 根木棍。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">簡單、易於製作，隨時可用！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>漏斗支援：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">1.19.2 - 2.8.0 版本新增了漏斗支援。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">在後方插入漏斗即可補充庫存！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">不支援付款槽位。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/35X5oIj.png\" alt=\"hopper support\" width=\"407\" height=\"229\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>相容性支援：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Apple Sapplings：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applesaplings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">內建支援！</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Colorful Azaleaa：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azalea-crates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Azalea Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Biomes O' Plenty：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plenty-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plenty O' Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Oh the Biomes You'll Go：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/byg-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Byg Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Integrated Dynamics：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Botania：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botanical-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botanical Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Malum：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malumian-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Malumian Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Premium Wood：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/premium-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Premium Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fruitful Fun：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fruit-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fruit Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Enlightend End：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightened-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enlightened Crates</a><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Solar Craft：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/solar-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Solar Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tinker's Construct：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/construct-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Construct Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forbidden And Arcanus：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden Crates</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">TerraFirmaCraft：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/firma-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firma Crates</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Riaw_d1tlz4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.2.0 版本新功能：</p>\n<p><strong>無限商店：<a href=\"https://github.com/ArtixAllMighty/AppleCrates/wiki/Unlimited-Shops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基文章</a></strong></p>\n<p>將箱子變成無限制的商店！（僅限擁有命令存取權限的管理員使用）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge：目前支援</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric：已支援</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Quilt：計劃中<br><br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">原生支援 [1.19.2 之前版本]：</span></strong><br></span></p>\n<p>Botania</p>\n<p>oh the biome's you'll go</p>\n<p>malum</p>\n<p>forbidden and arcanus</p>\n<p>premium wood</p>\n<p>biomes o plenty</p>\n<p>fruit trees</p>\n<p>enlightened-end</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Am6SHjW.png\" alt=\"support\" width=\"415\" height=\"353\"><br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎加入我的 Discord 伺服器與我交流！始終歡迎提供建議和錯誤回報。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8MEdFZh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/fr/4/4f/Discord_Logo_sans_texte.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"71\" height=\"80\"></a></p>",
